; --- appended 2026-10-03 -------------------------------------------------------
; Bonded terms for ATB / QFL / HFL, from CGenFF 4.6 on the CA-methyl side-chain
; analogs. Terms involving the analog's capping methyl are retyped CG331 -> CT1 and
; HGA3 -> HB1, since in the residue that position IS the protein CA; that retyping is
; how core's existing 'CT1 CG321 CG311 CG302 ... PENALTY=12 TFLE' term was produced,
; and it is numerically identical to the 4.6 value. Terms already present in core are
; omitted. Use CGenFF 4.6, not 5.0: 5.0 gives a different torsion profile for that
; same dihedral (two terms, 180/1.757/m3 + 0/1.966/m4) and would contradict TFLE.

[ bondtypes ]
CG311     CG312     1         0.15200000  142256.00 ; QFL

[ angletypes ]
CT1       CG321     CG302     5         111.629997  443.671356  0.25105000  6694.40  ; ATB, cap CG331->CT1 HGA3->HB1
CG321     CG311     CG312     5         111.980003  444.340790  0.25015000  6694.40  ; QFL
HGA1      CG311     CG312     5         110.099998  289.532806  0.21789999  18853.10 ; QFL
CG312     CG311     CG312     5         111.980003  444.340790  0.25015000  6694.40  ; QFL
CG311     CG312     HGA7      5         112.000000  267.776001  0.21680000  2510.40  ; QFL
CG311     CG312     FGA2      5         112.000000  418.399994  0.23570000  25104.00 ; QFL
CG302     CG311     CG302     5         108.650002  446.432800  0.24925999  6660.93  ; HFL

[ dihedraltypes ]
