; --- appended 2026-10-04: 4,4,4-trifluorovaline (TFV) ------------------------
; Harvested from the shipped V2TV topology, which carried these as explicit
; per-interaction parameters rather than as types -- which is why NTL9 ran but was
; NOT reproducible from core. B-state (trifluorovaline) values are used.
;
; The chi1 series is the one thing NOT taken from that topology. There the
; backbone->CG1 torsions kept only a generic 3-fold term in the trifluoro state,
; so VAL's 1/2/3-fold series was flattened: 4 terms (NH1/C -CT1-CT1-CG302 at
; multiplicities 1 and 2) had no B-state counterpart at all. CF3 is sterically a
; methyl, so CG302 is given the same series CT3 has in VAL.
[ bondtypes ]
CT1       CG302     1   0.15200000   209200.00 ; TFV
